[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8257.83, "timestamp": "02:17:37", "text": "？不過它晚上8點就關門了。啊，它要關門了。  他媽的。它要關門了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8260.07, "timestamp": "02:17:40", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8263.19, "timestamp": "02:17:43", "text": "拉屎。它關門了。  關門"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8267.589, "timestamp": "02:17:47", "text": "時間到了。那我就去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8271.429, "timestamp": "02:17:51", "text": "那區域逛逛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8274.469, "timestamp": "02:17:54", "text": "兄弟，你注意力在哪裡？ [音樂] 攝影機對焦太差了。  什麼是焦點問題？"}]